_refine.details                                  
;HYDROGENS HAVE BEEN ADDED IN THE RIDING POSITIONS. HYDROGENS HAVE BEEN USED IF PRESENT IN THE INPUT. U VALUES REFINED INDIVIDUALLY. RESIDUES B1 AND B21-B30 ARE DISORDERED RESIDUES B1 AND B21-B30 ARE DISORDERED HENCE NOT INCLUDED IN THE MODEL. ONLY THE CALPHA AND CO ATOMS FOR GLUB21 HAVE BEEN MODELLED. TYRB16 IS VERY MOBILE WITH ONLY SOME TERMINAL DENSITY FOR ITS SIDE CHAIN MISSING. THERE IS A LONG TUBULAR ELECTRON DENSITY NEXT TO, FOR EXAMPLE, GLUA4 SIDE CHAIN. AS IT APPEARS ALONG THE 4-FOLD AXIS, DOES NOT REPRESENT ANY CRYSTALLISATION SOLVENT, AND IS NOT A PART OF THE PROTEIN IS HAS BEEN LEFT UNMODELLED.
;
